    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thorny, vine-like whip springs into being and lashes at a creature in range on your command. Make a melee spell attack against it. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 Piercing damage, and you can pull it up to 10 feet closer to you if it is Large or smaller.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-o4KwahaAPr4KPiD6\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The damage increase is automated. The pull isn’t: move a Large or smaller target up to 10 feet toward you.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
